# The sdist already ships tests/*.py; without the fixtures those tests error
# on missing audio the moment anyone runs them from a source install. Ship the
# audio too (~1.3 MB) so the suite is runnable from the sdist — this is a
# validation-heavy project and its tests are the evidence the implementation
# matches its reference.
include LICENSE
include README.md USAGE.md
recursive-include tests/fixtures *.wav *.flac
